      "Context": "Changelog.AddGeneralChangelogs",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Disabled error messages in chat when using a tweak command in a macro after using '/macroerror off'.",
      "Translated": "在使用“/macroerror off”后，于宏中使用调整项命令时，禁用聊天中的错误消息。",
      "Context": "Changelog.AddGeneralChangelogs",
      "PreserveID": false,
      "Source": "library"
    },
    {
      "Original": "Fixed issues with some tweaks not saving their settings correctly.",
      "Translated": "修复了部分调整项无法正确保存设置的问题。",
      "Context": "Changelog.AddGeneralChangelogs",
